{"title": "Prowl", "pageid": 14386, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Prowl", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp/300px-Generic_Invisibility.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp/300px-Generic_Invisibility.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Generic_Invisibility.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Prowl</b> is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Panther\" title=\"Wild Shape: Panther\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape: Panther\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Wild_Shape_Panther_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Panther\" title=\"Wild Shape: Panther\">Wild Shape: Panther</a> Action. Panthers use this ability to turn invisible and stalk their prey.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Turn <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> while stalking your prey. While Invisible, your first attack deals an additional 1d8 damage. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Invisibility ends early if you attack, cast another spell, take an action, or take damage.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt